        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagonzibwa, nkooku twina ebyaraganiziibwe ebi, katwoge oburofu bwona obw'omubiri n'obw'omwoyo, tube bahikiriire mali, tutiine Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naasiima muno Abakorinto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutatiina kutwanjururra emitima yanyu. Tiharoho muntu n'omu ou twakozire kubi, tiharoho n'omu ou twasiisire, tiharoho n'omu ou twagobiize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu tindukukigamba kubacwera omusango, habwokuba mbagambiire ira nkooku mutuli ha mutima; tuliba tuli hamu omu kufa rundi omu kwomeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbeesiga muno; nimunyehuliza muno; mumpumwize muno. Noobu turaaba twina enaku ezirukwingana ki, baitu nyina omuhimbo ogutagambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Kor 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangwa noobu twahikire Makedoni, emibiri yaitu etahuumule naakake, baitu twabonaga enaku embaju zoona-aheeru bwabaga bulemu, omu nda butiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Ruhanga anyakuhuumuza abasobirwe, akatuhuumuza habw'okwija kwa Tito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tikuli kwija kwe kwonka, baitu n'okuhuumuzibwa oku mwamuhuumwizemu. Akatutebeza ekihika kyanyu, okuganya kwanyu, n'obwekambi mwayolekere habwange. Bikanyongera kusemererwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noobu ndaaba nababihiize habw'ebbaruha ei nabahandiikiire, tindukukyeijukya. Nkabanza kukyeijukya, habwokuba nindora ebbaruha egi ekabasaaliza okumara akasumi kake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu hati ninsemererwa, tihali habw'okusaalizibwa kwanyu, baitu okusaalizibwa oku mwatungire kukabaleetera okwegarukamu. Inywe mukasaalizibwa nka Ruhanga oku yagondeze; itwe titwina eki twabaferiize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okusaalirwa Ruhanga nkooku agonza kuleeta okwegarukamu okurukuhikya ha kujunwa, kandi okusaalirwa oku timukweijukya; baitu okusaalirwa kw'ensi enu kurugwamu okufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nu murole okusaalirwa oku Ruhanga yabagondiize nkooku kwabeekambisiize: nkooku mwataireho muno omutima okwetonganirra, nkooku mwasaalirwe, oku mwatiinire, oku mwagizire ekihika, oku mwayekambiire, oku mwafubire abaasobeze! Omuli ebi byona mukeeyoleka nkooku mutaina musango omu bigambo ebi nabahandiikiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahabweki obu ndaaba nabahandiikiire, ntabahandiikire habw'ogu ayasobeze, rundi habw'ogu ou baasobezeho; baitu nkabahandiikira nukwo mbooleke obwekambi obu mwatugiriire nkooku Ruhanga abwetegeriize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo kyatuhuumwize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tikuli okuhuumuzibwa kwaitu oku kwonka, baitu tukeeyongera kusemererwa muno habw'okurora omuhimbo gwa Tito, habwokuba inywena mukamugarra omutima omu nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu ndiba nnamwolekere nkooku ndukwesiima habwanyu, eki kitankwase nsoni. Ningira buli kintu kyona eki twabahaisizeho kyali ky'amazima, n'okwehaisa kwaitu omu maiso ga Tito nikweyoleka nkooku kuli kw'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutima gwe gwona guhweriire hali inywe obu arukwijuka obuhulizi bwanyu, n'oku mwamutangiriire nimutiina kandi numutukumira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nyowe ninsemererwa habwokuba nimbeesigira kimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
